# Materiel database migrations

This directory is the official, versioned Alembic migration environment.

Rules:
- Every schema change gets a new revision under versions/.
- Existing data must be preserved.
- SQLite changes must use Alembic batch operations when needed.
- Do not edit an already-applied migration; add a new revision instead.
- The initial revision is a baseline for the schema that existed when formal migrations were introduced.
